WEBVTT

00:04:28.681 --> 00:04:33.227
I think about our first fellow,
Alex Halstead.

00:04:33.227 --> 00:04:37.773
Dillard University attendee,
arbitrary major.

00:04:37.773 --> 00:04:41.027
Like a lot of our young Black men,
walking around Dillard’s campus,

00:04:41.027 --> 00:04:42.528
not much direction.

00:04:42.528 --> 00:04:45.614
Creative writing major,
didn't have a plan,

00:04:45.614 --> 00:04:48.784
was told to go to school
like a lot of us was told to go to school

00:04:48.784 --> 00:04:51.329
because it's the right thing to say
from your parents.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.164
Alex had no true direction.

00:04:53.205 --> 00:04:56.000
Alex came to our program,
we put Alex in front of the kids.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.376
He became a mirror,

00:04:57.418 --> 00:05:01.130
but also they became
a mirror for him as well.